{"notice_id":24255388,"sections":[{"kind":"Lot","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"LOT-0001","values":[{"field_id":"BT-01(c)-Procedure","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"vob-a-eu"},{"field_id":"BT-115-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"BT-124-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"https://evergabe-mv.de/Satellite/notice/CXVHYDNY12KEN28X"},{"field_id":"BT-13(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-11-19T23:59:00+01:00"},{"field_id":"BT-131(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-11-27T14:00:00+01:00"},{"field_id":"BT-132(d)-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2024-11-27T14:00:00+01:00"},{"field_id":"BT-137-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0001"},{"code":"required","field_id":"BT-17-Lot","list":"esubmission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-18-Lot","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"https://evergabe-mv.de/Satellite/notice/CXVHYDNY12KEN28X"},{"field_id":"BT-21-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Einsteinstraße 21-23 Los 5 - Dachdecker"},{"field_id":"BT-22-Lot","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"internalID","type":"id","value":"070/2024/10/02-08/24_VST"},{"code":"works","field_id":"BT-23-Lot","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-24-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Durchgeführt werden die mittlere Instandhaltung und Sanierung der Einsteinstr. 21-23 in Neubrandenburg mit Strangsanierung, Zusammenlegung von Wohnungen und Anbau von Balkonen."},{"field_id":"BT-300-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"#Besonders geeignet für:selbst#"},{"field_id":"BT-536-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2025-05-26"},{"field_id":"BT-537-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"date","value":"2025-07-10"},{"field_id":"BT-58-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"no-eu-funds","field_id":"BT-60-Lot","list":"eu-funded","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-63-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-70-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"keine"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-717-Lot","list":"cvd-scope","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-726-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"code":"no","field_id":"BT-736-Lot","list":"reserved-execution","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"required","field_id":"BT-743-Lot","list":"einvoicing","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-751-Lot","list":"tender-guarantee-required","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"false","field_id":"BT-761-Lot","list":"required","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-764-Lot","list":"ecatalog-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-765-Lot","list":"framework-agreement","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"none","field_id":"BT-766-Lot","list":"dps-usage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-767-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"code":"not-allowed","field_id":"BT-769-Lot","list":"permission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"late-all","field_id":"BT-771-Lot","list":"missing-info-submission","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Die Unterlagen sind vollständig einzureichen. Soweit die Unterlagen unvollständig sind und auch nicht in der gesetzten Frist zur Nachforderung beigebracht werden, ist das Angebot auszuschließen."},{"code":"nyk","field_id":"BT-79-Lot","list":"requirement-stage","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"DEU","field_id":"BT-97-Lot","list":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-98-Lot","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"DAY","value":54.0},{"field_id":"BT-99-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Es wird verwiesen auf § 160 GWB:\n(1) Die Vergabekammer leitet ein Nachprüfungsverfahren nur auf Antrag ein.\n(2) Antragsbefugt ist jedes Unternehmen, das ein Interesse an dem öffentlichen Auftrag oder der Konzession hat und eine Verletzung in seinen Rechten nach § 97 Absatz 6 durch Nichtbeachtung von Vergabevorschriften geltend macht. Dabei ist darzulegen, dass dem Unternehmen durch die behauptete Verletzung der Vergabevorschriften ein Schaden entstanden ist oder zu entstehen droht.\n(3) Der Antrag ist unzulässig, soweit:\n1. der Antragsteller den geltend gemachten Verstoß gegen Vergabevorschriften vor Einreichen des Nachprüfungsantrags erkannt und gegenüber dem Auftraggeber nicht innerhalb einer Frist von 10 Kalendertagen gerügt hat; der Ablauf der Frist nach § 134 Absatz 2 bleibt unberührt,\n2. Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die aufgrund der Bekanntmachung erkennbar sind, nicht spätestens bis zum Ablauf der in der Bekanntmachung benannten Frist zur Bewerbung oder zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber dem Auftraggeber gerügt werden,\n3. Verstöße gegen Vergabevorschriften, die erst in den Vergabeunterlagen erkennbar sind, nicht spätestens bis zum Ablauf der Frist zur Bewerbung oder zur Angebotsabgabe gegenüber dem Auftraggeber gerügt werden,\n4. mehr als 15 Kalendertage nach Eingang der Mitteilung des Auftraggebers, einer Rüge nicht abhelfen zu wollen, vergangen sind. Satz 1 gilt nicht bei einem Antrag auf Feststellung der Unwirksamkeit des Vertrags nach § 135 Absatz 1 Nummer 2. § 134 Absatz 1 Satz 2 bleibt unberührt."},{"code":"performance","field_id":"OPT-060-Lot","list":"conditions","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-AddInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewInfo","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-ReviewOrg","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0004"},{"field_id":"OPT-301-Lot-TenderReceipt","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0005"},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicOrderUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"UBL-ElectronicPaymentUsage","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1}]},{"kind":"ContractingParty","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ContractingParty#0","values":[{"code":"hc-am","field_id":"BT-10-Procedure-Buyer","list":"authority-activity","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"code":"pub-undert","field_id":"BT-11-Procedure-Buyer","list":"buyer-legal-type","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-508-Procedure-Buyer","lang":null,"ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"http://www.neuwoges.de"},{"field_id":"OPT-300-Procedure-Buyer","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#0","values":[{"code":"bankr-nat","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zwingende bzw. fakultative Ausschlussgründe nach §§ 123 bis 126 GWB"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#1","values":[{"code":"bankruptcy","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zwingende bzw. fakultative Ausschlussgründe nach §§ 123 bis 126 GWB"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#10","values":[{"code":"insolvency","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zwingende bzw. fakultative Ausschlussgründe nach §§ 123 bis 126 GWB"}]},{"kind":"ExclusionGrounds","parent_section_id":"PROCEDURE","section_id":"ND-ExclusionGrounds#11","values":[{"code":"labour-law","field_id":"BT-67(a)-Procedure","list":"exclusion-ground","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"BT-772-Lot","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Zwingende bzw. fakultative Aussc